# chthonic's menu (plan §41.11a): a beginner's subset of the one command
# vocabulary, in the format of profiles/default.menu. No Build, Project or
# Views rows: the power surface is not advertised. Run ▸ Stop, Run ▸
# Language… and View ▸ Variables join as their commands land (Stop on the
# toolbar too).

File editfile Open…
File save Save [editable]
File saveas Save As… [editable]
File -
File quit Quit

Edit undo Undo [editable && !viewing]
Edit redo Redo [editable && !viewing]
Edit -
Edit find Find…

Run replrun Run

View repl Shell
View problems Problems

Help help Help

# The toolbar (the placement word `toolbar`, plan §41.11a): its buttons.
toolbar editfile Open
toolbar save Save [editable]
toolbar replrun Run
